  "ruleText": "Agr 1405.15 Vehicle Scales; Form Sclgcap. Service technicians shall complete and submit to the division the “Placed in Service/Inspection Report Form Sclgcap” when installing, servicing, repairing, reconditioning, or performing annual testing of commercial vehicle scales.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Agr 1400) #12424, eff 12-1-17",
